## Why This Is Asked
This question probes practical SRE skills: incident triage, region-aware rollouts, backpressure, circuit breaking, and rollback discipline beyond basic incident response.

## Key Concepts
- Multi-region latency analysis
- Cache stampede mitigation
- Per-region deployment strategies (canary, rollouts)
- Safe rollback criteria and instrumentation

## Code Example
```javascript
// Simple circuit breaker (pseudo)
class CircuitBreaker {
  constructor(threshold) { this.open = false; this.failures = 0; this.threshold = threshold; }
  onFailure() { this.failures++; if (this.failures > this.threshold) this.open = true; }
  allow() { return !this.open; }
}
```

